, Variant_Classification, Variant_Type, Tumor_Sample_Barcode \nKey-column values identical: TRUE \nFull table identical: TRUE \nUnique genes MCP: 16686 \nUnique genes Direct R: 16686 \nUnique samples MCP: 1026 \nUnique samples Direct R: 1026 \nRepresentative row indices: 1, 2, 100, 1000, 85864 \nRow 1 MCP: GATA3 | 10 | 8115874 | 8115875 | Frame_Shift_Ins | INS | TCGA-3C-AAAU-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nRow 1 Direct R: GATA3 | 10 | 8115874 | 8115875 | Frame_Shift_Ins | INS | TCGA-3C-AAAU-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nRow 2 MCP: CD248 | 11 | 66082467 | 66082467 | Missense_Mutation | SNP | TCGA-3C-AAAU-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nRow 2 Direct R: CD248 | 11 | 66082467 | 66082467 | Missense_Mutation | SNP | TCGA-3C-AAAU-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nRow 100 MCP: ITPK1 | 14 | 93412799 | 93412799 | Missense_Mutation | SNP | TCGA-3C-AALI-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nRow 100 Direct R: ITPK1 | 14 | 93412799 | 93412799 | Missense_Mutation | SNP | TCGA-3C-AALI-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nRow 1000 MCP: PIK3C3 | 18 | 39584443 | 39584443 | Missense_Mutation | SNP | TCGA-5L-AAT1-01A-12D-A41F-09 \nRow 1000 Direct R: PIK3C3 | 18 | 39584443 | 39584443 | Missense_Mutation | SNP | TCGA-5L-AAT1-01A-12D-A41F-09 \nRow 85864 MCP: PHF8 | X | 54014379 | 54014379 | Splice_Site | SNP | TCGA-Z7-A8R6-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nRow 85864 Direct R: PHF8 | X | 54014379 | 54014379 | Splice_Site | SNP | TCGA-Z7-A8R6-01A-11D-A41F-09 \nb9062dbbd9b8e197807fc8a9ce8b2c6d\nb9062dbbd9b8e197807fc8a9ce8b2c6d\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
